From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aether Browser Maintainers <maintainers@aether.browser>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [ui] Implement compact 48dp toolbar layout and user-customizable button layout
Feature: FEAT-12, FEAT-13
Origin: original

Reduces vertical toolbar height from 56/64dp to 48dp to maximize reading space
on tall mobile displays. Tightens padding, shrinks action button targets to 40dp,
and implements a dedicated 'Customize Toolbar' settings screen allowing users to
toggle visibility of the uBO shield, extensions container, home, share, and
new-tab buttons dynamically.
